2 CONT
2 CONT '''10 July 1620: Instrument of Sasine following on a precept of clare constat for infefting William Grott, as eldest son of William Grott of Tankerness . . . . . Witnesses to the precept, William Sinclair of Tothorp . . . . . [htt
2 CONC ps://archive.org/details/calendaroflaing00edin/page/443 Calendar of the Laing Charters, A.D. 854-1837,  https://archive.org/details/calendaroflaing00edin/page/587to the University of Edinburgh. Edited by The Rev. John Anderson, As
