2 CONT '''23 April 1657: Charter by which Mr. Patrick Graham of Rothisholm confirms that he has given to his son James,  the lands of Rothisholm and the twenty-four penny land of Aeth, together with the towmale that formerly belonged to 
2 CONC the late William Sinclair of Tolhoip. [https://archive.org/details/calendaroflaing00edin/page/587 Ibidem, charter number 2502 on p. 587]'''
