2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/saintclairsofisl00sain#page/139/mode/1up/search/barbara+halcro The St. Clairs of the Isles, pp. 139-141 for the Sinclairs of Tohop and Saba]
