2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Bellenden/6000000047953014931?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1506496391765&through=6000000047950064827
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the Register if the Privy Council of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT 24 July 1627: Caution by Adame Ballenden of Steanehouse and George Bellenden, his son, each for the other, 500 merks, not to molest William Luitit in Begiswall, nor his household. [https://archive.org/stream/registerprivyco03coung
2 CONC oog#page/n81/mode/1up The Register of the Privy Council of Scotland, Second Series, Vol. II. A.D. 1627-28, page 21]
2 CONT
