1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES SINCLAIR OF TOHOP beneath the yardis===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The identity of James Sinclair of Tohop beneath the yardis here treated is uncertain. The late Roland William Sinclair identified him from the 1595 Rental of the Bishopric of Orkney [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=hvd.h
2 CONC xjui2;view=1up;seq=147 Peterkin's Rentals, p. 17] and suggested that he was: "the link intermediate between umqle. Mansie and his oy and air." In his narrative account of the family he places him between John Sinclair of Tobe (flo
2 CONC ruit 1592-1600) and William Sinclair of Tohop (floruit 1615-51). [https://archive.org/stream/saintclairsofisl00sain#page/140/mode/1up The Saint-Clairs of the Isles, p. 140]'''
