2 CONT '''Margaret Buchan married John King of Warbuster.  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefou02paulgoog#page/n611/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, iii, p. 590] The marriage was booked on 2 March 1641, at Ellon in Aberdeenshire, Scotl
2 CONC and. The marriage record reads as follows: "John King of Warbystoun maried with Margaret Buchane dochter to umqll James Buchane". [National Records of Scotland, Ellon Marriages, 1638-1818, reference OPR.192/3] [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/documents/view?doc_id=6000000078558123312& Image of Marriage Record]'''
