1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elias junior enlisted as a musketeer in the 'Livregiment till fot in 1691', and eventually became promoted to lieutenant in that regiment. He was captured at Lubow in December 1711, and returned home in March 1713.
2 CONC  Hamilton was again promoted, and again captured in 1716 at Wismar. He was released again, served for a while as captain and then left service in September 1719 with the rank of Stadsmajor in Kalmar. He married Anna von der Leith 
2 CONC in 1707 /Not correct/ and had numerous children with her
