1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This entry is a conflation of two people with the same name. One who married a McDonald and one who married a Maclean. Other more reliable sources list them as two different people with two different fathers. This 
2 CONC entry belongs to the Jennette Mackenzie that married Sir Hector Og Maclean an entry for the other Jennette Mackenzie already exists. The errors here are being duplicated at Familysearch. I just spent all day correcting the errors 
2 CONC at Familysearch, someone else will have to make the corrections here. The links at Wikidata contain multiple secondary references to reference works that show the correct lineage. We should leave a message here so they do not get 
2 CONC conflated again. There are easily a half-dozen Jennette Mackenzies or Janet Mackenzies in the Mackenzie of Kintail clan born within 20 years of each other. (Source: Richard Arthur Norton on January 3, 2021)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jennette Mackenzie, daughter of Colin Mackenzie of Kintail, and wife of Sir Hector Og Maclean, 15th Chief, 11th of Duart https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q75592752
2 CONT
2 CONT Jennette Mackenzie, daughter of Kenneth Mackenzie of Kintail, and wife of Donald Gorm Og MacDonald https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q75446688 https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Mackenzie/6000000002188039969
