1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARGARET WILSON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Wilson is the wife of Alexander Sinclair. Her husband died before 17 March 1522-23, the date upon which their daughter Cristiane Sinclair sold all her rights and heritage in Orkney and Shetland to John Sinclair of Toll
2 CONC op. [https://archive.org/stream/recordsofearldom00clou#page/205/mode/1up Records of the Earldom of Orkney, charter number CII on pp. 205-06] Her daughter Margaret Sinclair transferred her rights in Orkney and Shetland to her son J
2 CONC ohn Sinclair. [https://archive.org/stream/recordsofearldom00clou#page/208/mode/1up Ibidem, charter number CIV on p. 208]'''
2 CONT
