1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===CRISTIANE SINCLAIR===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cristiane Sinclair is the daughter of Thom Sincler (aka Alexander Sinclair) and his wife Margaret Wilson. Her sons William Paulsoun and Henry Paulson sold their deceased mother's heritage rights in Orkney and Shetland to John S
2 CONC inclair of Tollop on 17 March 1522-23 [https://archive.org/stream/recordsofearldom00clou#page/205/mode/1up Records of the Earldon of Orkney, charter number CII on pp. 205-06]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cristiane Sinclair married Magnus Paulson (aka Mawnis Pawlsoun). [https://archive.org/stream/recordsofearldom00clou#page/205/mode/1up Records of the Earldon of Orkney, charter number CII on pp. 205-06]'''
2 CONT
