1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir George Acheson, Baronet [S 1628] of Market Hill</strong>, brother of the half-blood and heir, being son of the 1st Baronet by his 2nd wife; baptized 4 August 1629, at Edinburgh; succeeded to the Baronetcy, 6 October 1
2 CONC 638; Sheriff for counties Armagh and Tyrone, 1657. He married firstly, (--) sister of Jane, Countess of Mountrath [I] daughter of Sir Robert Hannay, 1st Baronet [S 1629], of Mochrum, by (--), daughter of (--) Stewart. He married s
2 CONC econdly, 3 November 1659, Margaret, 3rd daughter of William (Caufield), 2nd Baron Charlemont [S], by Mary, daughter of Sir John King. He died 1685."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n353/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 335
