1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This man was not the Earl of Glencairn. You can find lists of the known Earls (e.g. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earl_of_Glencairn) and he is not among them:
2 CONT
2 CONT William Cunningham, 6th Earl of Glencairn (1526–1580)
2 CONT James Cunningham, 7th Earl of Glencairn (1552–1630)
2 CONT William Cunningham, 8th Earl of Glencairn (1575–1631)
2 CONT William Cunningham, 9th Earl of Glencairn (1610–1664)
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition, his supposed father William the 6th Earl did not have a son named Arche or Archibald or any variant. The owner of this profile should remove the relationships to the parents shown here.
2 CONT
2 CONT As far as I can tell from actual records, Archibald Cunningham married Janet Dagleich. There are records of baptisms for 6 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen (1576)
2 CONT Katherine (1580)
2 CONT Marion (1583), who m. John Rowan in 1614 and had at least one or two surviving children from 3-4 pregnancies recorded in baptisms in Dunfermline; she might also be the woman who apparently m. and had 5 children from 1602-1612 with
2 CONC  James Kaye in nearby Kinghorn.
2 CONT Emmie (1586)
2 CONT Janet (1588) who m. Crispaine Swyne in 1612 in Dysart.
2 CONT James (1591)
