1 NAME Carl Filip /von Blixen/
2 GIVN Carl Filip
2 SURN von Blixen
2 _MARNM von Blixen-Finecke
2 NICK Philip
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 MAR 1749
2 PLAC Stralsund, Mecklenburg-Vorpommen, Germany
