2 CONT "<strong>Sir Nicholas Acheson, Baronet [S 1628] of Market Hill</strong>, son and heir by 1st wife; succeeded to the Baronetcy, 1685; Sheriff of Armagh, 1695; M.P. [I] for the same, 1695-99. He married 1686, Anne, sister of Sir Tho
2 CONC mas Taylor, 1st Baronet [I 1704], only daughter of Thomas Taylor, of Kells, co Meath, by Anne, daughter of William Axtell, of Berkhampstead, Herts. He died 1701."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n353/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 335
