2 CONT
2 CONT Since John Og passed away before his own father, Sir Lachlan Mòr MacKinnon (the 28th Chief), he never actually held the title of Chief himself.Skipping a Generation: When Sir Lachlan Mòr died around 1700, the chiefship skipped the
2 CONC  deceased John Og and passed directly to the grandson, Iain Dubh, making him the 29th Chief.
