2 CONC  a charter from the Crown. These lands, besides the 20 lands of Gigha, comprised 16 merklauds in Kintyre, 5 merklands in Islay, and 8 merklands in Knapdale, with the office of Toshachdorach of all the lands of Kintyre. Archibald w
