1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == DAME MARGARET CUNNINGHAM ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Margarete Cunynghame (1552) Margarete Cunynghame (1558) Dame Mgaret Cunnynghame sum tyme spous to Andro Lord Uchiltrie (1575) Dame Mgaret Cunnynghame sum tyme spouse to Andro Lord Stewart of Uchiltrie (1575)'''</blo
2 CONC ckquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Margaret Cunningham, here treated, is the daughter of Alexander Cunningham, Earl of Glencairn, and his wife Janet Hamilton. The date and place of her birth is not known. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04paulu
2 CONC oft/page/241/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 241]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Margaret Cunningham, here treated, died intestate in June 1573. The place of her death is not known. [NRS: CC8/8//3] [NRS: CC8/8/4]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Her First Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The testament dative and inventory of the deceased Dame Margaret Cunningham, sometime spouse of Andrew Stewart, Lord Ochiltree: "was ffaithfullie maid & givin up be Johne Wallace now of Craigie in name and behalf of Williame Wa
2 CONC llace hir sone". Confirmation was granted on 17 January 1576. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, Testament Dative and Inventory of Dame Margaret Cunynghame, sometime spouse to Andrew, Lord Ochiltrie, refere
2 CONC nce CC8/8/3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187069893822 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187069794831 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Her Second or Additional Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Margaret Cunningham died intestate in June 1573. On 31 May 1576 the additional testament dative and inventory of the deceased Dame Margaret Cunningham, sometime spouse of Andrew Stewart, Lord Ochiltree: "was faithfullie ma
2 CONC id & givin up be Johne Wallace now of Craigie in name and behalf of Wm Robert Michael Alan [ Martha ] & Sara Wallaces hir lauchfull bairnis." Confirmation was granted to the executors dative on 5 June 1576. [National Records of Sc
2 CONC otland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, Dame Margaret Cunningham, sometime spouse to Andrew Lord Ochiltrie, reference CC8/8/4]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000194595523830 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000194595467844 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000194595041853 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == First Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Margaret Cunningham married, first, to John Wallace of Craigie. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/241/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 241]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
