2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''8 August 1552: Charter under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirms possession of the lands of Ricartoun and others to John Wallace of Cragy and his wife Margarete Cunynghame. The lands in question were to be held by John an
2 CONC d Margaret in conjunct fee and liferent. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi04scot/page/156/mode/1up RMS 1546-80: charter number 703]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 July 1558: Charter under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirms possession of the lands of Prevek in the Kyle-Stewart division of Ayrshire to John Wallace of Cragy and his wife Margarete Cunynghame. The land in question wa
2 CONC s to be held by John and Margaret in conjunct fee and liferent. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi04scot/page/289/mode/1up RMS 1546-80: charter number 1289]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Printed Evidence == 
