2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James {SIC GENI HAS JOHN}  his heir''' by [https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Crichton/6000000006768448247 Margaret his wife {GENI Profile} ] and heir of Robert Crichton of Kilpatrick had five and five daughters 
