1 NAME William /Cuninghame/ 8th Earl of Glencairn
2 GIVN William
2 SURN Cuninghame
2 NSFX 8th Earl of Glencairn
2 _MARNM Cuninghame
2 NICK William Cunningham
2 NICK Cunynghame
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1575
2 PLAC Glenorchy
