2 CONT      Lady Mary Cuninghame is the daughter of James Cuninghame, 7th Earl of Glencairn and Margaret Campbell.2 She married John Crawfurd of Kilbirnie, son of John Crawfurd of Kilbirnie and Margaret Blair.1
