1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === ROBERT FERGUSSON OF CRAIGDARROCH ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Fake Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''At least six pedigrees published on the internet identify Robert Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated, as the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Ferguson-Seedman-in-Edinburgh/6000000184015245829?th
2 CONC rough=6000000183995447846 and the husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Gardiner/6000000183995447846?through=6000000014585399699 [For Links See Below] This is wrong.'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated, is the son and heir of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Fergusson-8th-Laird-of-Craigdarroch/6000000024871543697?through=6000000014585399699 He is noticed on 3 February 1601, durin
2 CONC g his father's lifetime, as Robert Fergusson, younger of Craigdarroch, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f173&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n
2 CONC  NRS: GD77/173] and on 3 December 1610, as Robert Fergusson, apparent of Craigdarroch. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD39%2f1%2f156&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&r
2 CONC o=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n NRS: GD39/1/156]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Robert Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated. He was alive on 5 September 1612, the date upon which he took possession, as his deceased father's son and heir, of various l
2 CONC ands in the barony of Glencairn, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f114&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n NRS: GD77/114] but he died before 23 
2 CONC February 1613, when his own son and heir had a precept of clare constat for the same lands. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f115&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&
2 CONC ro=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n NRS: GD77/115]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == First Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson, here treated, is reported to have married, as his first wife, https://www.geni.com/people/Geillis-Maxwell/6000000178762335883?through=6000000014585399699 [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ff/fergusso
2 CONC n02.php Stirnet: Fergusson 02]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
