2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Katherine-Cunningham/6000000177170383853?through=6000000014585399699 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/242/mode/1up 
