2 CONC rt's wife on the day that he died, and she is noticed as his widow on 31 October 1614. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f99&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroche&ko=p&r=&ro=s&
