2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 1 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson, of Craigdarroch was born in 1566, at birth place , to John Fergusson and Agnes Fergusson (born Kirkpatrick) . John was born in 1541, in Craigdarroch, Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland, United Kingdom. Agnes was 
2 CONC born in 1545, in Craigdarroch. Robert had 4 siblings: John Fergusson and 3 other siblings . Robert married Jean Fergusson (born Cunningham) . Jean was born in 1567, in Lochinver, Sutherland, Scotland. They had 7 children: William 
2 CONC Ferguson , John Ferguson and 5 other children . Robert then married Geillis Ferguson (born Maxwell) . Geillis was born in 1570, in Dumfries-shire, Scotland. Robert then married Margaret Ferguson (born Gardner) . Margaret was born 
2 CONC in 1572, in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland, United Kingdom. They had 2 children: Edward Fergusson and one other child . Robert lived at address . His occupation was a occupation . Robert passed away on month day 1611, at age 45 a
2 CONC t death place . He was buried at burial place .[https://www.myheritage.com/names/robert_fergusson MyHeritage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 2 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''When Margaret Gardner was born in 1567, in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland, her father, James Gardner, was 12 and her mother, Mrs James Gardner, was 12. She married Robert Rad Ferguson 11th Laird of Craigdarroch on 19 August 16
2 CONC 00. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 9 November 1611, in Craigdarroch, Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 44. [https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/MPJM-3RV/margare
2 CONC t-gardner-1567-1611 FamilySearch]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 3 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Gardiner.(1578 - 1604). Born in Edinburgh, , Midlothian, Scotland on 1578 to John Gardner and Margaret Thomesoune. Margaret Gardiner married Robert Ferguson and had 1 child. She passed away on 13 Aug 1604 in Craigdarro
2 CONC ch, Glencairn, Dumfries, Scotland. [https://www.ancestry.co.uk/genealogy/records/margaret-gardiner-24-20y1jzy?geo_a=r&geo_s=us&geo_t=uk&geo_v=2.0.0&_ga=2.54287272.1472305465.1649217378-1859080310.1634552207&o_iid=41013&o_lid=41013
2 CONC &o_sch=Web+Property Ancestry]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 4 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Laird Robert Ferguson 9 th Laird of Craigdarroch. Born in 1566 - Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. Deceased 9 November 1611 - Craigdarroch, Dumfries & Galloway, Scotland, aged 45 years old Parents John Fergusson, 8th Laird of Cr
2 CONC aigdarroch 1531-1614 Agnes Kirkpatrick 1545-1572 Spouses and children Married about 1581 to Margaret Gardner 1578-1604 with M John Ferguson 10th Laird of Cragidarroch 1597-1628 [https://gw.geneanet.org/tonyansett?lang=en&iz=3024&p
2 CONC =laird+robert&n=ferguson+9+th+laird+of+craigdarroch Geneanet]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 5 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Ferguson Born about 1566 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotlandmap Son of John Ferguson and Agnes Kirkpatrick [sibling(s) unknown] Husband of Geillis Maxwell — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Husband of Jean Cunnin
2 CONC gham — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Husband of Jean Cuninghame — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Husband of Margret (Gardner) Ferguson — married 19 Aug 1600 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotlandmap Father of Jo
2 CONC hn Ferguson, Barbara Ferguson, Elizabeth Ferguson, William Ferguson, Edward Ferguson, Thomas Ferguson, Thomas Ferguson, William Ferguson, John Fergussone, William Fergusson and	Robert Ferguson Died 9 Nov 1611 in Scotland [http://w
2 CONC ww.wikitree.com/wiki/Ferguson-3288 Wikitree]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 6 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson was the 9th Laird of Craigdarroch, he was Seedman, & Burgess of Edinburgh. Robert was born in c. 1566, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland ; he died on November 9, 1611, at the Estate of Craigdarroch, Glencairn, Du
2 CONC mfries-shire, Scotland. He married as his 2nd wife, JEAN CUNNINGHAME, born c. 1567, Dumfries-shire, Scotland ; died c. 1596, Scotland. She is the mother of both the 10th, & the 11th Lairds of Craigdarroch. Robert Fergusson & his 2
2 CONC nd wife, Jean Cunninghame, had issue two known, viz.: (1) John Fergusson, born c. 1585, Craigdarroch ; he died c. 1628, he was the 10th Laird of Craigdarroch, nothing futher. (2) William Fergusson, born c. 1590, Glenncairn, Dumfri
2 CONC es-shire, Scotland ; he died AFTER 1631, Craigdarroch ; he was the 11th Laird of Craigdarroch. William Fergusson married SARA GRIERSON, born BEFORE 1598, Lag Tower, Dumfries-shire, Scotland, they had a marriage contract dated May 
2 CONC 9, 1621 ; she died AFTER 1631, at the Estate of Craigdarroch, in Glencairn, Dumfries-shire, Scotland. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/147533635/robert-fergusson Find A Grave]'''
2 CONT
