1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hector_Maclean,_2nd_Laird_of_Torloisk
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector MacLean, 2nd Laird of Torloisk, son of Lachlan Og MacLean, 1st Laird of Torloiskwas a second time married to Catherine, daughter of John Campbell of Lochnell, and had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Lachlan Maclean, 3rd Laird of Torloisk, who succeeded him
2 CONT #Hector Maclean of Torloisk, who was killed by Clan Maclachlan, a band of robbers of Fiairt, in Lesmore, who infested the neighborhood
2 CONT #John of Tarbert who was married to Catherine, daughter of Donald Campbell of Comguish, by whom he had #Donald Maclean, 5th Laird of Torloisk, John, and Marianne who married Charles MacLean of Kilunaig
2 CONT #Isabella Maclean of Torloisk, married to Lauchlan Maclean, 2nd Laird of Brolas
2 CONT #Jannet Maclean of Torloisk, married to Hector MacLean 2nd Laird of Kinlochaline.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disputed Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I33540&tree=CC
2 CONT
2 CONT * Stirnet Stewart22 calls Catherine daughter of John 4th of Lochnell but link to Campbell09 shows her as daughter of Alexander 3rd of Lochnell.
2 CONT * Her marriage to Eachuinn Maclean is not shown in Stirnet Campbell09 that covers the Campbells of Lochnell.
2 CONT * MacLean database shows her as dau. of Iain (John) Campbell of 4th Lochnell so there may in fact be two Catherines.
2 CONT * LDS Medieval Families Unit shows her as daughter of John 4th of Lochnell & Anne Campbell and shows marriages for John Beg Campbell & Hector MacLean.
2 CONT * Landed Families of Perthshire by Gordon MacGregor calls her Margaret dau. of John Campbell 4th of Lochnell and which makes no other references to any other marriages.
2 CONT * I therefore assume these are two different daughters and have allocated Catherine and her two husbands to Alexander 3rd of Lochnell and created a Margaret dau. of John 5th of Lochnell with husband Donald Stewart 5th of Invernahy
2 CONC le
2 CONT
