1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Fegræus, Thorbern'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1631-04-14
2 CONT * 1658 lector in Skara, Skaraborg
2 CONT * oo 1660 with Ursula Loccenia
2 CONT * 1671–1681 vicar and rural dean in Mariestad, Skaraborg (took office 1673)
2 CONT * 1672, 1675 & 1680, member of parliament
2 CONT * † 1689-04-30
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
2 CONT
