1 NAME Rudolf Hodder /Ahlberg/
2 GIVN Rudolf Hodder
2 SURN Ahlberg
2 _MARNM Ahlberg Stiernswärd
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 FEB 1728
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kristianstad
3 STAE Skåne County
3 CTRY Sweden
