1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Carl Gustaf Frölich=
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Fr%C3%B6lich_nr_49#TAB_3 '''Carl Gustaf Frölich'''] was a Swedish military officer of German descent, Riga Governor in 1700-1706 and infantry general. He was the brother of a Pietist writer an
2 CONC d mystic [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eva_Margareta_Fr%C3%B6lich '''Eva Margareta Frölich'''] and a colonel '''Hans Frederik Frölich'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Born in 1637 in the''' family of the Swedish Army officer colonel '''Hans Christoffer Frölich''' and his wife '''Elizabeth''', born [https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plessen_(Adelsgeschlecht%29 '''von Plessen'''].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Frölich became''' Lieutenant-Major of the Swedish Army and Commander in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohus_Fortress Bohus Fortress] in 1676. In 1678 he became Lieutenant-Colonel. In the summer of 1678 Bohus fortress was besie
2 CONC ged by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulrik_Frederik_Gyldenl%C3%B8ve '''Ulrik Frederik Gyldenløve'''] and an army of 7,000 German and 9,000 Norwegian soldiers. Bohus Fortress had a Swedish crew of 900 men, led by Colonel [https://
2 CONC sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedrich_B%C3%B6rstell '''Friedrich Börstell'''] and then Lieutenant Colonel Frölich. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The fortress was''' fired for two months with quantities of cannonballs, bombs, rock bumps, glowing bullets, grenades and mines. The attackers also used catapult to throw in bags with latrine for the purpose of spreading diseas
2 CONC e. The Swedish crew, however, managed the siege, but more than half the crew did. After the siege, Frölich became colonel and commander in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marstrand Marstrand]. He became a naturalized Swedish noblem
2 CONC an.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In 1693 he became''' Major-General at Västernorrland County, Jämtland and Härjedalen.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The new King of''' Sweden [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_XII_of_Sweden '''Karl XII'''] appointed Frölich as commander of the Hälsinge Regiment in 1698 and, after the commencement of the Great Northern War on 12 March 17
2 CONC 00, was promoted to Governor of Riga and lieutenant-general.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From April 18, 1702''', he also served as Governor General of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vidzeme Vidzeme], Sweden, and during the invasion of Russian troops in 1704, he was promoted to infantry general and commander of the 
2 CONC Riga garrison.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On January 17, 1706''' he was dismissed as Governor General before the siege of Riga (1709-1710) due to an unsuccessful attempt of monetary reform. He left Vidzeme and returned to Sweden, where he died in 1714.
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Fr%C3%B6lich_nr_49#TAB_3 '''Carl Gustaf Frölich''', ''naturaliserad, friherre och greve'' '''Frölich'''], född 1637 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kornett vid överste''' Vollmar Wrangels regemente 1665. Kaptenlöjtnant vid Kalmar regemente 1670. Kapten vid Jämtlands regemente. Major vid Jämtlands regemente 1676. Överstelöjtnant och kommendant på Bohus 1676. Överste och kom
2 CONC mendant på Marstrand 1678. Kommendant i Malmö 1679. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Naturaliserad svensk''' adelsman 1682-12-28 (introducerad mellan n:o 976 och 977 eller under n:o 951 i gamla matrikeln). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Generalmajor av''' infanteriet 1693. Tillika landshövding i Västernorrland, Jämtland och Härjedalen 1693. Tillika överste för Hälsinge regemente 1698. Guvernör i Riga 1700. Generallöjtnant av infanteriet 1700. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Friherre 1700''' (ej introducerad). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Generalguvernör''' i Riga 1702. General av infanteriet 1704. Överste för garnisonsregemente i Riga 1704. K. råd 1705. President i Dorpats hovrätt 1705. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Greve 1706-06-21''' (sönerna 1719 introducerad under n:o 49). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Död 1714-03-03''' i Stockholm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1:o''' med '''Plantina Margareta Bengtsdotter''', död 1690-09-23 i Marstrand, dotter av översten Bengt Ragvaldsson och Anneken von Kugeln samt syster till majoren Johan Cederbaum, adlad [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealog
2 CONC i/Cederstr%C3%A5hle_nr_1563 Cederstråhle]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 2:o''' med [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Cronstr%C3%B6m_nr_786 '''Beata Christina Cronström'''], född 1671-12-20, död 1752-12-09 och begraven 1752-12-24 i Järlåsa kyrka, Uppsala län, dotter av kammarrådet Isak Kock
2 CONC , adlad Cronström, och Christina Hanssén.
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
